   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 14652602,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SPOF: Main Controller legacy (unico). Mitigacion: Circuit Breaker + Retry\n  + timeout en el Strangler Router; Main nuevo en parallel run (shadow).\nBottleneck: Log DB (escrituras 6 000 mediciones/s). Mitigacion: cola\n  asincrona + Read Replica + Cache-Aside en el Dashboard.\nSPOF eliminados: Controller 1, Main nuevo y Alert Service con Replicas + LB /health.",
   "originalText": "SPOF: Main Controller legacy (unico). Mitigacion: Circuit Breaker + Retry\n  + timeout en el Strangler Router; Main nuevo en parallel run (shadow).\nBottleneck: Log DB (escrituras 6 000 mediciones/s). Mitigacion: cola\n  asincrona + Read Replica + Cache-Aside en el Dashboard.\nSPOF eliminados: Controller 1, Main nuevo y Alert Service con Replicas + LB /health.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
